      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel this kind of change is too specific to chromium build or plugin used by chromium clang.\n\nRather than having this kind of change in GN, can we start from showing command to get target having path/to/bar.h with GN and asking users to add that to deps of foo in clang plugin?",
      "revId": "f042becd9bec40ac3f1017b72cc85b7da38aad62",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
