      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T03:49:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not a huge fan of changing the output format of an existing command. How about a new subcommand?\n\n```\ngn suggest //path/to:foo_Private\u003dpath/to/bar.h //path/to:bar\u003dbaz/baz.h //path/to:foo\u003dundeclared.h\n* Add `deps \u003d [ \":bar\" ]` to `//path/to:foo` (declared at path/to/BUILD.gn:123)\n* Add `public_deps \u003d [ \"//baz:baz\" ]` to `//path/to:bar` (declared at path/to/BUILD.gn:456)\n* Add `public \u003d [ \"undeclared.h\" ] to `//path/to:foo` (declared at path/to/BUILD.gn:123) (or perhaps to one of its dependencies)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "e836e7ac_d9022935",
      "revId": "f042becd9bec40ac3f1017b72cc85b7da38aad62",
      "serverId": "c360c8e5-7aa8-3905-a7a0-810934766dac"
    },
